2
00:00:10.778 --> 00:00:16.545
It was Monday morning, and Ben was stuck in his least favorite class.

3
00:00:16.546 --> 00:00:22.357
Cooking was boring, and Ben was terrible at it.

4
00:00:22.358 --> 00:00:28.395
Winnie looked over from her workstation. "Ben, your soup is smoking."

5
00:00:28.396 --> 00:00:30.703
