7
00:00:35.315 --> 00:00:38.290
Ben looked at all the jars on his counter.

8
00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:44.123
He saw dried lizard toes, rat tails, and several other items.

9
00:00:44.124 --> 00:00:49.552
He shrugged. "Honestly, I don't remember what I put in it."

10
00:00:49.553 --> 00:00:54.151
Winnie burst out laughing, and Ben joined in.

11
00:00:54.152 --> 00:00:58.886
The only good thing about Cooking class was that Winnie was in it.

12
00:00:58.887 --> 00:01:01.973
