13
00:01:01.974 --> 00:01:05.008
"What are you two laughing about?"

14
00:01:05.009 --> 00:01:07.823
"Uh, nothing," Ben said.

15
00:01:07.824 --> 00:01:12.022
Suddenly— Boom!

16
00:01:12.023 --> 00:01:15.149
Splat! "Oh, man!" Mog

