70
00:04:46.441 --> 00:04:49.730
After class Ben was at his locker.

71
00:04:49.731 --> 00:04:53.175
Waldo poked his head out of a nearby classroom.

72
00:04:53.176 --> 00:04:58.792
"Psst, Ben!" he whispered. "Come here!"

73
00:04:58.793 --> 00:05:02.583
Ben went in, and Waldo closed the door behind him.

74
00:05:02.584 --> 00:05:06.870
Gaby, Deb, Mog, and some other monsters were there.

75
00:05:06.871 --> 00:05:09.270
"Quick meeting," Waldo said.

76
00:05:09.271 --> 00:05:12.782
"We need to discuss Winnie's surprise party."

77
00:05:12.783 --> 00:05:15.819
"She almost figured it out," Ben said.

78
00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:19.019
"I pretended to not know about any party."

79
