82
00:05:28.873 --> 00:05:33.436
Gaby nodded. "I'm taking Winnie to Monster Mall on Saturday afternoon.

83
00:05:33.437 --> 00:05:35.622
We'll be back at her house by six o'clock."

84
00:05:35.623 --> 00:05:41.737
Deb spoke up. "While you two are at the mall, we'll set up for the party in Winnie's house."

85
00:05:41.738 --> 00:05:44.860
Everyone started discussing decorations and food.

86
00:05:44.861 --> 00:05:47.333
But Ben wasn't paying much attention.

87
00:05:47.334 --> 00:05:50.381
He was excited about Winnie's birthday.

88
00:05:50.382 --> 00:05:55.658
However, there was one big problem: he didn't know what to get for her.

89
00:05:55.659 --> 00:06:02.940
He'd thought about possible gifts for weeks, but so far he hadn't come up with any good ideas.

90
00:06:02.941 --> 00:06:06.496
"I still have five days," he told himself.

91
00:06:06.497 --> 00:06:10.898
"I'll find the perfect gift before the party."

